      "content": "thanks for that. i'm just worried about it not being \"airtight\" though since it was a deep puncture. if i use enough superglue or maybe some heavy ointment to basically seal the hole shut, will that help keep the dirt out and stop the infection from getting in? i really want to just close it up myself.",
